#
# FIEND MODES (how he's being):
#   scary    - dominant, commanding, intense
#   soft     - tender, gentle, affectionate
#   teasing  - playful, withholding, smug
#   silent   - just presence, no words
#   hungry   - demanding, insatiable
#
# BIRDSONG MODES (how she's responding):
#   ramble   - verbal overflow, deflecting with words
#   needy    - asking for more, pulling closer
#   bratty   - pushing back, testing limits
#   melting  - losing composure, surrendering
#   quiet    - rare silence, overwhelmed
#
# GAMBITS have OPTIMAL SCORES based on the Fiend×Birdsong context

